{"title":"Removing Stars From A String","difficulty":"Medium","statement":" Process each `*` by removing it and the closest preceding character not already removed. The input guarantees every operation is possible.\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1\n\n```text\nInput: s = \"leet**cod*e\"\nOutput: \"lecoe\"\n```\n\nExplanation: Performing the removals from left to right:\n- The closest character to the 1st star is 't' in \"leet**cod*e\". s becomes \"lee*cod*e\".\n- The closest character to the 2nd star is 'e' in \"lee*cod*e\". s becomes \"lecod*e\".\n- The closest character to the 3rd star is 'd' in \"lecod*e\". s becomes \"lecoe\".\nThere are no more stars, so we return \"lecoe\".\n\n### Example 2\n\n```text\nInput: s = \"erase*****\"\nOutput: \"\"\n```\n\nExplanation: The entire string is removed, so we return an empty string.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- 1 <= s.length <= 10^5\n- s consists of lowercase English letters and stars *.\n- The operation above can be performed on s.\n","starterCode":"class Solution:\n    def removeStars(self, s: str) -> str:\n        pass\n","entryPoint":"Solution().removeStars","parameters":[{"name":"s","type":"str"}],"returnType":"str","tests":[{"input":["a"],"expected":"a"},{"input":["a*cf*uxnhzx****nx**x*sm"],"expected":"cuxsm"},{"input":["a*dnkyikk***ejitxukgemw**xmvu"],"expected":"dnkyejitxukgexmvu"},{"input":["a*e*thupn*j*fmz*em*gd*f**l*my*ncj*zny*qa**rl"],"expected":"thupfmemncznrl"},{"input":["a*ej*qzbljxmp**cg**lm*tvs*vhag"],"expected":"eqzbljxltvvhag"},{"input":["a*ftq*faey*xupoi*i*pipc*fgimcpo*yqgb*bdx**owz*j*jm*cqssyl"],"expected":"ftfaexupopipfgimcpyqgbowjcqssyl"},{"input":["a*gz*et"],"expected":"get"},{"input":["a*h*u*pudlfc*l*negpqqaqjgymu*"],"expected":"pudlfnegpqqaqjgym"},{"input":["a*liy*z*kcyu*u**yp*voeb"],"expected":"likcyvoeb"},{"input":["a*p*qkvauxdmtp**mvlz*iqm*jzlm*m*w*bh"],"expected":"qkvauxdmmvliqjzlbh"},{"input":["a*u*ohx*bdsug"],"expected":"ohbdsug"},{"input":["a*yg*sr*a*"],"expected":"ys"},{"input":["ahonvx*s***qwoyt